/** @dir Lib/Miro/TypeExport
    The codegen runner (namespace Miro::TypeExport), included through
    `<Miro/Codegen.h>`.

    - codegenMain<Api...>(argc, argv) is the whole main() of a codegen
      executable: it walks each API class's reflect() and writes one file
      per requested format.
    - Formats register themselves at static-init time with registerFormat;
      the built-in ones are zod, ts, backend, ts-server, bridge, events,
      jsonschema, openai-tools, cpp, cpp-miro and cpp-client.
    - A Format renders from a Context: the commands, events and type nodes
      collected from the API classes.
*/
